# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Steps to get the real key:
#   1. Sign in to https://developer.amazon.com/
#   2. Open your app listing → App Services → Appstore SDK → Security Profile
#   3. Download "AppstoreAuthenticationKey.pem"
#   4. Replace this entire file with the downloaded PEM content
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY WARNING:
#   • Add this file to your .gitignore so the real key is NEVER committed to git.
#   • Keep this placeholder committed so the build doesn't fail on CI.
#   • The Amazon SDK will operate in sandbox / test mode while this placeholder is present.
#
